      "entity_id": "mention:383dc357f114b4c061e9e2b7",
      "predicate": "SOURCE_STATEMENT",
      "value": "The consulted source reports that vessels armed in Leghorn (Tuscany) and flying a Maltese flag depredated two vessels anchored in the harbour of Patrnos, laden with food provisions for the islanders.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "src_25330e6382c43e1ab1b2696cc64e6902",
